PalletTown_School_Text_Teacher::
    .string "Welcome to the GRENALUX SCHOOL!\p"
    .string "Our pride is the GRENAT in the science\n"
    .string "case, a gem that hums when a POKéMON's\l"
    .string "AURA is near.\p"
    .string "Legend says the GRENAT is tied to\n"
    .string "JIRACHI's wish. Ten years ago, the\l"
    .string "AURA changed every POKéMON's type...\p"
    .string "Funny how nobody knows why.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_Student::
    .string "My grandpa says FIRE POKéMON were\n"
    .string "only FIRE once. Now look at them...\p"
    .string "He says the world turned upside down,\n"
    .string "and all he did was grow old.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_GarnetCase::
    .string "A glass case on the science shelf.\n"
    .string "It holds the GRENAT, a deep red gem\l"
    .string "that glows when POKéMON gather near.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_AuraCase::
    .string "The AURA of ten years ago.\n"
    .string "Records show every POKéMON's type\l"
    .string "changed in a single night.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_TeacherStrike::
    .string "They came at dawn, all in black.\n"
    .string "They took the GRENAT before I could\l"
    .string "even reach the alarm.\p"
    .string "They said it was for the POKéMON,\n"
    .string "for their freedom... What does a\l"
    .string "gem have to do with freedom?\p"
    .string "There is no class today.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_StudentStrike::
    .string "Grandpa says thieves used to hide\n"
    .string "their faces. These ones were proud\l"
    .string "of it.\p"
    .string "We got the day off, but nobody feels\n"
    .string "like playing.$"

PalletTown_School_Text_GarnetCaseStrike::
    .string "The glass case is empty. A note is\n"
    .string "left behind: POKéMON were never\l"
    .string "meant to be owned. - TEAM ONYBRIS$"
